        <item>
            <title>0.20</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:11:46 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202609101311</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.20</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Bold black ink on tiles, boxes and cones keep off the writing and inside their tile</li>
<li>No board offices before GitHub has said who I am</li>
<li>An office already on the floor is no proof of work; only peers' claims and checkouts are</li>
<li>Dark ink on tiles, names as floor signage, open pull requests only, no archive flapping</li>
<li>Board column decides an office's solidity, not its existence; board state persists across launches</li>
<li>Yard and cues from the GitHub project board, offices for issues in development, release notes from commits</li>
<li>Translucent feet under props, the office hex without a plane, cones land clear of crates near the door</li>
<li>A cell under a crate is no destination: walks settle for the nearest free floor</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
